---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="bg-forest-950 text-white">
  <div class="site-container grid gap-10 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.35fr_.65fr_.65fr]">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-sun-400 text-forest-950"><Icon name="sunrise" /></span>
        <div>
          <strong class="font-serif text-xl">二寮日出指南</strong>
          <p class="text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-white/50">ERLIAOSUNRISE.COM</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/60">協助旅人在天亮前做出更好的出發決定。本站不是官方單位，日出與雲海條件僅供行程規劃參考。</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-extrabold text-sun-300">快速連結</p>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm text-white/65">
        <a class="hover:text-white" href="/sunrise-time/">日出時間表</a>
        <a class="hover:text-white" href="/live/">即時影像</a>
        <a class="hover:text-white" href="/weather/">天氣與雲海</a>
        <a class="hover:text-white" href="/transportation/">交通與停車</a>
        <a class="hover:text-white" href="/#conditions">明早觀景條件</a>
        <a class="hover:text-white" href="/#faq">常見問題</a>
        <a class="hover:text-white" href="/credits/">照片與資料來源</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-extrabold text-sun-300">官方資訊</p>
      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm text-white/65">
        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href="https://www.siraya-nsa.gov.tw/zh-tw/service/live-camera/1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">二寮即時影像 <Icon name="external" size={14} /></a>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href="https://www.siraya-nsa.gov.tw/zh-tw/attractions/detail/30" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">西拉雅景點資訊 <Icon name="external" size={14} /></a>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href="https://www.cwa.gov.tw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">中央氣象署・天氣與日出日沒 <Icon name="external" size={14} /></a>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href="https://www.twtainan.net/zh-tw/attractions/detail/569/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">台南旅遊網 <Icon name="external" size={14} /></a>
        <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-white" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/KVSX2Gm83RceQEGh6" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google 地圖・評價與導航 <Icon name="external" size={14} /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="site-container flex flex-col gap-3 py-6 text-xs text-white/45 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} ErliaoSunrise.com</p>
      <div class="flex gap-5"><a class="hover:text-white" href="/privacy/">隱私說明</a><a class="hover:text-white" href="/credits/">授權標示</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
